const z = sin(ang*0.9)*1.4 + cos(ang*0.5)*0.9 + 0.3;
sprite.position.set(x,y,z);
sprite.material.rotation = ang*1.7;
const sc = 0.12+...; sprite.scale.set(0.18, 2.6+sin*0.8,1); opacity = power*(0.06+0.16*...);
```
Ensure no giant beams; use tinted. For glows, position near top of a ribbon, scale 0.9, opacity .2.

