   const cycle = ((t*1.05*boost + k*1.9 + s.seed*0.7) % 13 + 13)%13;
   const y = -1.2 + cycle;
   const x = s.laneBase? lanes[s.lane].group.position.x : ...
```
Use lane group position x at current. But lane group rotates; windRoot not rotated by lane; use lane base x (`lanes[s.lane].group.position.x`). Good.
