content.text:
Now startGame boss mode. Patch around startGame. Ensure setBossIntro helper exists before use; define near UI helpers maybe after toast. Let's add helpers first after toast function.

Helpers: setBossIntro, showCaption, hideCaption, glitchScreen.

```
function setBossIntro(on){
 bossIntro=on;
 document.body.classList.toggle('boss-intro', on);
 if(!on) hideCaption();
}
function hideCaption(){ clearTimeout(captionTimer); dom.bossCaption?.classList.remove('on'); set aria hidden true; }
function showCaption(ev){ clearTimeout; text; aria false; force reflow add on; if hold>0 timer hide; }
function glitchScreen(power){ ... }
```
`glitchTimer` clearTimeout when number. Use `window.setTimeout`.
`dom.bossGlitch` remove/add. CSS animation. Set opacity? animation ends at 0; class stays but animation not looping; fine. Remove class after 340ms.

Add after toast.

