Good. Now write and run full autoplay. 145 seconds; take ~2.6 min. Use timeout 240000. I'll include screenshots at hold moments (35.5s), 8-lane (112.5s), and results. To capture hold mid-way, the bot keeps key down but the visual hold body shows, fine.

Set up:
- open page 1440x900
- select boss, start
- wait for audio.time > 0
- install scheduler
- every 15s print progress via polling from node (page.evaluate) — optional, but no need; maybe print at 35.5 and 112.5 with screenshots.
- To take screenshots at specific times, in node: wait until audio.time >= X via page.waitForFunction.
- At t>=142.5 waitForFunction state==='results', wait 2.2s, screenshot, read stats.
- Check all notes states: done counts. Holds complete checks? `stats.dropped`.
- If score perfect, rank S+ and full combo.
- Also verify no error.

Autoplay scheduler:
```
await page.evaluate(() => {
  const codes=['KeyA','KeyS','KeyD','KeyF','KeyJ','KeyK','KeyL','Semicolon'];
  window.__botInfo={scheduled:0};
