```
But camera.position.z during intro is 48; not used. During play ~18.4. On desktop halfW= tan(23°)*18.4*1.6 = 0.4245*18.4*1.6=12.5; min(7.2,10.7)=7.2. Good.
Portrait: fov 52? boss event sets fov 46-52. at 46, halfW=0.4245*18.4*0.46=3.6; edge=min(6.45, 3.1)=3.1. Wind at x±3.1, visible just inside. Good.

However all streams on the left (lanes 0-3) get the same edge except alternating +0.45 spacing; lanes 0,1,2,3 all left? `stream.lane < 3.5` → lanes 0,1,2,3 all left, so four streams at nearly same x. In 4-lane mode, unused are 0,1,6,7 → left two, right two, fine. In 6-lane, unused 0,7 → left, right. In 8-lane, all active. So fine. But during transitions between key counts, inactive lanes might be e.g. 0,1 and 6,7. okay.

For intro, all 8 wind streams spread across lane x. good.

One more: lane line dim. In the lane update:
```
const lineTarget = (live ? (i%2?0.86:0.96)*0.58 : ghostAmp*0.34) * field;
