Add `* (boss.active ? 0.62 : 1)` to live. And maybe reduce `beamTarget` already *0.55. Line is the bright white. Do 0.55. Let me apply. But note strings add to the aesthetic; dimming to 55% keeps them.

Also, note that inactive lane lines outside field are invisible anyway.

Let's implement.

