This is a feedback loop; let me implement it as a small fixed-point loop (max 4 iterations) with monotone adjustments (only increasing fov, only lowering pitch?, only dollying back). Termination guaranteed.

But dolly after fov widening... Let me structure:

```
function bossPlayFraming(dt) {
  // camera already positioned/looked
  let fov = camera.fov;
  const fovMin = fov, fovMax = 58;
  // 1. pitch so rings sit at target height
