But do not call scene.setIntentionPhase in reset because menu preview should set phase preview after. In quitToMenu, call resetIntent then scene.setBoss(preview). Fine. In resetGame, resetIntent then scene is already intro phase; but resetIntent setting phase off could conflict. We'll not call scene in resetIntent.

