Also maybe hit holds: judgeHit called once at head. completeHold could add .6. Add in completeHold intentJudged('perfect')? That would refill strongly. Hold ticks add health but tiny. Keep.

`updateIntent(dt,t)`:
- heartbeat pulse.
- guilt drain: density ahead.
```
if (intent.guiltOn && !intent.fakeGuilt) {
